# Geeklego Token Editor — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; .env.example is committed.

# Google Fonts Developer API key — enables the live font catalog in the Token Editor's
# font picker (Fonts module). Read SERVER-SIDE only by the /api/google-fonts dev endpoint;
# it never ships to the browser. Without it, the picker falls back to a small curated list.
# Get a free key: https://developers.google.com/fonts/docs/developer_api
GOOGLE_FONTS_API_KEY=
